OL,3,GNEWSALegal advice delays for detained
OL,4,Amigrants - report
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetained migrants due to be sent to
OL,7,FFrance can wait up to a week without
OL,8,Fgetting legal help, according to a
OL,9,Freport.
OL,11,FAn inspector wrote that detainees at
OL,12,FTinsley House Immigration Removal
OL,13,FCentre had to wait to attend advice
OL,14,Fsurgeries, which some "attended several
OL,15,Ftimes before receiving representation".
OL,17,FThe centre, near Gatwick Airport,
OL,18,Fmostly holds small boat arrivals to be
OL,19,Freturned to France under the "one in,
OL,20,Fone out" deal that sees the UK take in
OL,21,Fmigrants believed to have a legitimate
OL,22,Fasylum claim.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
